{
  "title": "Fit a line with gradient descent",
  "function": "fit_line",
  "params": [
    {
      "name": "xs",
      "type": "vec"
    },
    {
      "name": "ys",
      "type": "vec"
    },
    {
      "name": "lr",
      "type": "float"
    },
    {
      "name": "epochs",
      "type": "int"
    }
  ],
  "returns": "vec",
  "library": true,
  "hints": [
    "The model is ŷᵢ = w·xᵢ + b, the loss is mse_loss(ŷ, ys), and w and b both start at 0.",
    "Let g = mse_grad(ŷ, ys). By the chain rule ∂L/∂w = Σ gᵢ·xᵢ = dot(g, xs), and ∂L/∂b = Σ gᵢ = vec_sum(g).",
    "Each epoch: compute ŷ, then g, then w −= lr·dot(g, xs) and b −= lr·vec_sum(g) (both from the same g). Return [w, b]."
  ],
  "tests": [
    {
      "args": [
        [
          0,
          1,
          2,
          3,
          4
        ],
        [
          1,
          3,
          5,
          7,
          9
        ],
        0.05,
        1000
      ],
      "description": "points on y = 2x + 1: recovers w ≈ 2, b ≈ 1",
      "expected": [
        2.0000000000000067,
        0.9999999999999818
      ]
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          0,
          1,
          2,
          3,
          4
        ],
        [
          1,
          3,
          5,
          7,
          9
        ],
        0.05,
        1
      ],
      "description": "after a single step",
      "expected": [
        1.4000000000000001,
        0.5
      ]
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          0,
          0.5,
          1,
          1.5,
          2,
          2.5,
          3,
          3.5,
          4,
          4.5
        ],
        [
          -0.9,
          -0.85,
          -0.4,
          -0.3,
          0.1,
          0.2,
          0.55,
          0.8,
          1.05,
          1.2
        ],
        0.02,
        2000
      ],
      "description": "noisy points around y = 0.5x − 1",
      "hidden": true,
      "expected": [
        0.49515151492080345,
        -0.9690909083872195
      ]
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          1,
          2,
          3
        ],
        [
          2,
          2,
          2
        ],
        0.1,
        500
      ],
      "description": "a flat line: w ≈ 0, b ≈ 2",
      "hidden": true,
      "expected": [
        3.834601471771505e-06,
        1.999991283049533
      ]
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          1,
          2
        ],
        [
          1
        ],
        0.1,
        10
      ],
      "description": "one y per x",
      "expect_error": true,
      "hidden": true
    }
  ]
}
